    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all the commanders of the forces, and Johanan the son of Kareah and Azariah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jezaniah",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the son of Hoshaiah, and all the people from the least to the greatest, came near ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said to Jeremiah the prophet, “Let our supplication come before you, and pray to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God for us, for all this remnant (for we are left but a few of many, as your eyes see us), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God may show us the way we should go, and the thing that we should do.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeremiah the prophet said to them, “I have heard you; behold, I will pray to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God according to your request, and whatever the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " answers you I will tell you; I will keep nothing back from you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they said to Jeremiah, “May the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " be a true and faithful witness against us if we do not act according to all the word with which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God sends you to us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whether it is good or evil, we will obey the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God to whom we are sending you, that it may be well with us when we obey the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the end of ten days the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to Jeremiah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he summoned Johanan the son of Kareah and all the commanders of the forces who were with him, and all the people from the least to the greatest, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said to them, “Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, to whom you sent me to present your supplication before him: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you will remain in this land, then I will build you up and not pull you down; I will plant you, and not pluck you up; for I repent of the evil which I did to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not fear the king of Babylon, of whom you are afraid; do not fear him, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", for I am with you, to save you and to deliver you from his hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will grant you mercy, that he may have mercy on you and let you remain in your own land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if you say, ‘We will not remain in this land,’ disobeying the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and saying, ‘No, we will go to the land of Egypt, where we shall not see war, or hear the sound of the trumpet, or be hungry for bread, and we will dwell there,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then hear the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", O remnant of Judah. Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, the God of Israel: If you set your faces to enter Egypt and go to live there, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then the sword which you fear shall overtake you there in the land of Egypt; and the famine of which you are afraid shall follow hard after you to Egypt; and there you shall die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the men who set their faces to go to Egypt to live there shall die by the sword, by famine, and by pestilence; they shall have no remnant or survivor from the evil which I will bring upon them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“For thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, the God of Israel: As my anger and my wrath were poured out on the inhabitants of Jerusalem, so my wrath will be poured out on you when you go to Egypt. You shall become an execration, a horror, a curse, and a taunt. You shall see this place no more. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has said to you, O remnant of Judah, ‘Do not go to Egypt.’ Know for a certainty that I have warned you this day ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that you have gone astray at the cost of your lives. For you sent me to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, saying, ‘Pray for us to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God, and whatever the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God says declare to us and we will do it.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I have this day declared it to you, but you have not obeyed the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God in anything that he sent me to tell you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore know for a certainty that you shall die by the sword, by famine, and by pestilence in the place where you desire to go to live.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
